KNOWNBUG
main.cpp
--cpp11
^\[main\.assertion\.1\] line \d+ function type: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.2\] line \d+ WRONG \(must FAIL\): FAILURE$
^VERIFICATION FAILED$
^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
